Test fixtures for test/crypto.test.ts and test/protect.test.ts, copied byte for byte from
permissively licensed projects. Each subfolder carries its project's licence:

- apache-poi/        Apache POI test-data/document (Apache-2.0): see apache-poi/LICENSE and
                     apache-poi/NOTICE. Pinned commit 47dcff769bb395034dddfd59c4609659b6dbc6a4.
- msoffcrypto-tool/  nolze/msoffcrypto-tool tests/inputs and tests/outputs (MIT): see
                     msoffcrypto-tool/LICENSE. Pinned commit
                     bdb71ea5dfbdee2f3cd86f8852e74be7a6f15667.

The files live one folder down so the round-trip corpus (test/helpers/fixtures.ts reads
test/fixtures/<source>/*.docx) does not pick up encrypted containers.
